        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SBP35, Small Modern Square Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Small Los Angeles Cabinet Pull comes packaged with everything you'll need to install it on your kitchen cabinets. It is just shy of 4 inches in total length, a great choice for smaller cabinet drawers and doors. The Small Modern Bar Cabinet Door Pull is available in several contemporary and popular finish colors; and no matter which finish you select for the exterior, this cabinet door pull features solid brass construction for long-lasting quality. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SBP35-specifications.gif?v=1704354675\" width=\"578\" height=\"171\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SBP35 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/large-los-angeles-cabinet-pull-deltana-sbp80\"><b>Deltana SBP80 Large Los Angeles Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SBP35-installed.jpg?v=1704354676\" width=\"282\" height=\"273\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Deltana SBP35 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Los Angeles Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 3-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount: 7/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed either vertically or horizontally.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SBP35-specifications.pdf?v=1704262367\"><b>Deltana SBP35 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
